# NB: This file has been produced using GenAI
# A conforming shape scope. No shipped example uses one, so without this the
# shape could be shown to fire but never to accept anything. A file called
# ok-X.ttl is a fixture that shape X accepts.
@prefix dal: <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/persistence#> .
@prefix ex:  <https://example.org/lending#> .
@prefix sh:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

ex:ThingShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:Thing .
ex:ThingByShape a dal:ShapeScope ; dal:targetShape ex:ThingShape ; dal:priority 5 .
